Error [E0128]: a `UserId` can't be compared with a `OrderId`
  --> tests/ui/distinct_mixup.jet:7:13
    |
  7 |     same #= u == o
    |             ^^^^^^
 Why: `UserId` is a distinct type; it only compares equal to another `UserId`
 Fix: use `.raw()` to compare the underlying values, or construct a `UserId`
